│ ☆  parity-bot  lazy-demo    ✘         █  The README's Keys section should say what this line does in a little        █▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▎│
│                                       █  more detail. Here's what I'd add:                                           █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  • j / k move one line and stop at either end of the file; they never        █                                       │
│                                       █    wrap around.                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  • G jumps to the last line and g to the first.                              █                                       │
│                                       █  • J / K move by hunk, and stop at the first and the last hunk.              █move.                                  │
│                                       █  • The arrow keys do the same as j and k, and page up and page down move     █                                       │
│                                       █    by a screen.                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  I checked each of these against the current build and they all behave as    █                                       │
│                                       █  described, so this is only a docs change. If you want, I can open a         █                                       │
│                                       █  follow-up for wrapping around at the ends, but I'd keep it behind a         █                                       │
│                                       █  setting so the default stays the same as today.                             █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  The help panel lists j as "Line down" but the footer says "Down". We        █                                       │
└───────────────────────────────────────█  should pick one; I'd go with the help panel's wording because it's more     █                                       │
┌─ [2] Pull Requests ───────────────────█  specific.                                                                   █");                                    │
│ #  Status  Author         Title       █                                                                              █;                                      │
│ 5  open    parity-friend  Add a cursor█  Steps I ran:                                                                █                                       │
│ 4  closed  parity-bot     Drop the leg█                                                                              █                                       │
│ 3  closed  parity-bot     Release 0.2.█   1. Open a file longer than the screen                                      █                                       │
│ 2  open    parity-friend  Try a faster█   2. Press G                                                                 █                                       │
│                                       █   3. Press j, then k, then g                                                 █                                       │
│                                       █   4. Press J and K on a file with three hunks                                █                                     ▆▆│
│                                       █                                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  Every one of them stopped where the docs will say it stops. The only        █                                       │
│                                       █  surprise was K on the first hunk, which does nothing rather than            █                                       │
│                                       █  wrapping to the last one, and that matches the rest.                        █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                              █nd?  · 1 reply                         │
│                                       █  The screenshot in the README is from 0.5 and still shows the old title      █                                       │
│                                       █  bar. It'd be worth refreshing it in the same PR.                            █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                              █                                       │
│                                       █  A few notes for whoever picks up the wrap-around follow-up:                 █                                       │
│                                       █                                                                          ▆▆  █                                       │
│                                       █  • keep the default as it is today                                           █                                       │
│                                       █  • put the setting next to the other viewer settings                         █                                       │
